Todo Calendar makes todo note easier and more organized planning.
Easily plan your schedule and set reminders.
The APP's calendar view makes the daily schedule clear at a glance.
Todos timeline to make the past and future clearly visible.
Helps you to use every minute efficiently and organize your life and work.

[Features]
Todo calendar integrates calendar, note, memo reminder and list functions, which can help you improve work efficiency more effectively, let you work and life more orderly, and help you track and develop good personal habits.
Calendar: Support display of solar calendar and lunar calendar, solar calendar holidays, lunar calendar holidays, twenty-four solar terms, etc.;
Todo Note: Support single-line and multi-line text notes, divided into to-do, done, and overdue types, as well as custom background colors, etc.;
Reminder: You can set an alarm reminder for to-do items and make a clock-in calendar;

【Use for】
Work: formulate project plans, set meeting reminders, arrange process planning;
Learning: reasonably plan learning time and formulate learning goals;
Life: make shopping lists, event memos and wish lists, etc.;
